<p class="greeting">Welcome to BackOffice NG 🎉</p>
<p class="intro">
  Hello {{firstName}}, your employee profile has been created on BackOffice NG.
  Sign in with your existing account credentials to view it.
</p>

<div class="info-card">
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Employee ID</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{employeeId}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Full Name</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{fullName}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Department</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{department}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Job Title</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{jobTitle}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Email</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{email}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Start Date</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{startDate}}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="info">
  BackOffice NG never sends passwords by email. If you cannot sign in, use
  the password reset option on the login page.
</div>

<div class="btn-wrap">
  <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn">Login to BackOffice NG</a>
</div>